The Grace Of Death

Many people are scared of death that includes you
reading this. But no one can escape the peacful death 
waiting for you at the end of the inclining steps.
Death is something we shouldn't fear because when 
your life comes to an end you'll ask for forgiveness 
from the people you wronged but instead you should 
enjoy death. It's a moment where everything will
go silent for the first and last time in your life.
So enjoy it and enjoy it with the people around you.
Don't overthink in this time instead reflect on the
gread life you lived and how far you've come just for 
2 minutes of silence, but at the end you'll realise 
everything you've done is something you chose to do,
good or bad, you chose it, that's the important part.
You can't change how you lived but only admire from 
a far distance, watching the dumb mistakes you made 
and laughing to yourself, thinking how lucky you are
to live such beautiful life.

